1
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:12,780
Hello sisters, this is Naheed.

2
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:19,300
Before we begin, please do not listen to this while driving

3
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:26,600
or while doing anything that needs your full attention.

4
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:32,380
Find a safe place to sit or lie down.

5
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:35,700
This is a short relaxation practice.

6
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:41,880
It is not a medical advice, and it is not a treatment.

7
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:47,300
If sleep problems continue, please speak to your doctor.

8
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:53,380
Alright, let's take these five minutes just for you.

9
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:56,510
Get comfortable.

10
00:00:57,190 --> 00:01:00,330
Let your shoulders drop.

11
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:06,140
Let your shoulders drop away from your ears.

12
00:01:07,830 --> 00:01:13,120
Let your hands rest wherever they are comfortable.

13
00:01:13,370 --> 00:01:21,720
If your eyes are open, let them soften.

14
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:25,150
If it feels comfortable,

15
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:28,520
you can close them.

16
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:36,590
Now notice the sounds around you.

17
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,730
A fan,

18
00:01:38,980 --> 00:01:41,640
a distant car,

19
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:45,020
the quiet of the room.

20
00:01:46,590 --> 00:01:50,580
You don't need to do anything with them.

21
00:01:50,830 --> 00:01:54,810
Just let them be there.

22
00:01:57,120 --> 00:02:02,670
There is nothing you need to fix right now.

23
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:06,940
Nothing you need to finish.

24
00:02:07,550 --> 00:02:11,210
This is your time.

25
00:02:12,490 --> 00:02:18,120
Let's breathe slowly, gently,

26
00:02:18,370 --> 00:02:22,840
no forcing, belly breathing.

27
00:02:23,090 --> 00:02:27,000
When you are breathing, the belly goes out.

28
00:02:27,250 --> 00:02:31,680
When you are exhaling, the belly goes in.

29
00:02:31,930 --> 00:02:37,220
Breathe in through your nose for a count of four.

30
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:43,080
One, two, three, four.

31
00:02:43,330 --> 00:02:50,720
And breathe out slowly through your mouth with a sigh for a count of six.

32
00:02:50,970 --> 00:03:02,000
One, two, three, four, five, six.

33
00:03:02,250 --> 00:03:06,100
Again in through the nose.

34
00:03:06,350 --> 00:03:10,780
Two, three, four.

35
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:12,380
And out slowly.

36
00:03:12,630 --> 00:03:22,080
Two, three, four, five, six.

37
00:03:22,330 --> 00:03:24,060
One more time.

38
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:29,640
In, two, three, four.

39
00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:39,740
And out, two, three, four, five, six.

40
00:03:39,990 --> 00:03:46,420
Now let your breathing go back to its natural rhythm.

41
00:03:46,670 --> 00:03:50,770
You don't need to control it anymore.

42
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:55,410
Bring your attention now to your forehead.

43
00:03:55,660 --> 00:04:00,900
Let it be soft, smooth.

44
00:04:01,530 --> 00:04:03,740
Feel relaxed.

45
00:04:03,990 --> 00:04:06,490
More relaxed.

46
00:04:07,250 --> 00:04:10,230
Let your jaw loosen.

47
00:04:10,850 --> 00:04:15,930
Let your teeth part slightly.

48
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:19,000
Relax.

49
00:04:21,140 --> 00:04:25,700
Let your neck and shoulders feel heavy.

50
00:04:26,210 --> 00:04:29,370
Loosen them.

51
00:04:30,150 --> 00:04:32,670
Feel relaxed.

52
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:41,460
Let your arm feel heavy all the way to your fingertips.

53
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:48,210
Notice your chest rising and falling on its own.

54
00:04:48,710 --> 00:04:51,840
Let your stomach be soft.

55
00:04:52,090 --> 00:04:56,460
You don't need to hold it tonight.

56
00:04:56,710 --> 00:04:58,950
Relax.

57
00:05:00,170 --> 00:05:04,080
Let your legs feel heavy, more heavy, more heavier.

58
00:05:04,330 --> 00:05:10,090
And your feet feel warm, relaxed.

59
00:05:10,510 --> 00:05:12,790
Feel relaxed.

60
00:05:13,890 --> 00:05:18,840
Now think of one thing from today that you can let go.

61
00:05:19,090 --> 00:05:21,780
Just one.

62
00:05:22,030 --> 00:05:23,780
A worry,

63
00:05:24,030 --> 00:05:28,240
a task, a conversation.

64
00:05:28,490 --> 00:05:36,150
And as you breathe out, imagine setting it down.

65
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:39,720
It will still be there tomorrow if you need it.

66
00:05:39,970 --> 00:05:45,950
But for tonight, you can put it down.

67
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:53,990
You have done something kind to yourself in this few minutes.

68
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,730
I acknowledge you.

69
00:05:55,980 --> 00:05:58,230
I appreciate you.

70
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:03,920
And you can come back to this any evening.

71
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:12,100
When you are ready, take one deep breath in and out.

72
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:16,470
If you would like to continue resting,

73
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:19,450
stay as you are.

74
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:22,590
If you need to get up,

75
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:29,530
gently move your fingers and toes and open your eyes.

76
00:06:29,780 --> 00:06:33,750
Thank you for taking this time.

77
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,670
Be kind to yourself tonight.

78
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:39,040
Good night.
